      "title": "魔鬼教练·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "24010001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "上次行动之后，她的包就一直挂在身上，完全没有下手的机会。有咲？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24010002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲·牧狼农场",
          "text": "所以要采取非常措施！\n会员卡的前两次订购记录分别是3号、13号，而今天是23号。优纪？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24010003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "放心，我已经安排好外援了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24010004",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "笃，笃，笃。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24010005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本里恵",
          "text": "您好......有人在吗，蛋糕口味涂料专营店外送。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24010006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "小声点！我不是备注了，敲门不要提「蛋糕」吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24010007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本里恵",
          "text": "啊！对......对不起......您的涂料。\n那个，请问要怎么支付呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24010008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "会员卡。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24010009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "（小声）里惠，就是现在！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24010010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "咳咳！你拿错货啦，这个海盐芝士的才对。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24010011",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "宫本里恵",
          "text": "紫色的扣子，紫色的扣子......看到了，在那！",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24010012",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "宫本里恵",
          "text": "手......手在抖，但是......为了樱，我也可以......做到的！",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24010013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "你们两个，有点面熟啊？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24010014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "怎么会，你认错了！\n走了，里惠，还要送下一家呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24010015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "等等，站住！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24010016",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "宫本里恵",
          "text": "被......发现了吗，会被当做小偷......抓起来吗？\n必须要......快跑，快跑！",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24010017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "我还.....没刷卡呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-550",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "jiujingwei",
          "rowIds": [
            24010001,
            24010002,
            24010003,
            24010004,
            24010005,
            24010006,
            24010007,
            24010008,
            24010009,
